(7638529, 1239738, 24454, '<td valign="top">Ohhhmygoodness!  I''m not voting, but this absolutely has to be the winner!  So exquisite!  I''m adding it to my favorites and using it as my bar in learning how to shoot low key images.</td>', 'Ohhhmygoodness!  I''m not voting, but this absolutely has to be the winner!  So exquisite!  I''m adding it to my favorites and using it as my bar in learning how to shoot low key images.', '2019-08-19 16:47:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(7638530, 1239610, 24454, '<td valign="top">This is one of the images in this challenge that takes my breath away.  I have a personal rule that I don''t vote in challenges I''ve entered (even tho my score is deservingly sucking), but this is one of two that I''ve seen that both deserve votes of 20 on a 1 to 10 scale!  I hope you both win the blue and red ribbons!  I will refer back to this image often as I try to get better at low key photography.  It''s absolutely perfect!</td>', 'This is one of the images in this challenge that takes my breath away.  I have a personal rule that I don''t vote in challenges I''ve entered (even tho my score is deservingly sucking), but this is one of two that I''ve seen that both deserve votes of 20 on a 1 to 10 scale!  I hope you both win the blue and red ribbons!  I will refer back to this image often as I try to get better at low key photography.  It''s absolutely perfect!', '2019-08-19 16:51:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(7638531, 1239447, 24454, '<td valign="top">What I love so much about this image is that it proves that with an amazing amount of talent and skill, natural light creates the most exquisite low key image!  This is in my top 3 picks, and is one that makes my heart flutter looking at it!</td>', 'What I love so much about this image is that it proves that with an amazing amount of talent and skill, natural light creates the most exquisite low key image!  This is in my top 3 picks, and is one that makes my heart flutter looking at it!', '2019-08-19 16:53:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(7638543, 1239738, 114285, '<td valign="top">Beautiful and professional, lighting is perfect, my top pick!</td>', 'Beautiful and professional, lighting is perfect, my top pick!', '2019-08-19 22:13:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(7638544, 1239752, 114285, '<td valign="top">Great moment!</td>', 'Great moment!', '2019-08-19 22:14:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(7638545, 1239690, 114285, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous shot!</td>', 'Gorgeous shot!', '2019-08-19 22:15:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(7638570, 1239869, 103142, '<td valign="top">I''m curious to have a low key discussion after this challenge is over. This doesn''t strike me as low key -- more as underexposed. Also, it could be a very interesting, evocative pose, but the lighting is just distracting. The lighting draws the eye to the shoulder and the ear, which hold no interest. Sorry...</td>', 'I''m curious to have a low key discussion after this challenge is over. This doesn''t strike me as low key -- more as underexposed. Also, it could be a very interesting, evocative pose, but the lighting is just distracting. The lighting draws the eye to the shoulder and the ear, which hold no interest. Sorry...', '2019-08-20 10:46:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(7638571, 1239802, 103142, '<td valign="top">This seems like it could be an interesting photo, but I get the feeling that it was made black and white to make it low key and not for aesthetic reasons. I want to like it, and it seems like it might be interesting in color, but falls flat for me here.</td>', 'This seems like it could be an interesting photo, but I get the feeling that it was made black and white to make it low key and not for aesthetic reasons. I want to like it, and it seems like it might be interesting in color, but falls flat for me here.', '2019-08-20 10:48:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(7638573, 1239776, 103142, '<td valign="top">This is closer to my thoughts of low key than other images. But the harsh shadows and the light area in the background are bothering me. The funny thing is: I''m thinking the shadows should be deeper, even though they''re quite harsh. My understanding of low key is in the challenge description: Mostly dark with few highlights. What if you darken all your shadows more? Would it make a more interesting photo? I''m not sure... 6 for being closer than others</td>', 'This is closer to my thoughts of low key than other images. But the harsh shadows and the light area in the background are bothering me. The funny thing is: I''m thinking the shadows should be deeper, even though they''re quite harsh. My understanding of low key is in the challenge description: Mostly dark with few highlights. What if you darken all your shadows more? Would it make a more interesting photo? I''m not sure... 6 for being closer than others', '2019-08-20 10:53:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(7638574, 1239470, 103142, '<td valign="top">This works for me. I like that the bright side of the face isn''t over exposed. The dark side of the face looks a little contrived on how dark it is. The curvy line on the forehead looks artificial, shadow-wise. Did you darken these? Or am I just not understanding the lighting? -7-</td>', 'This works for me. I like that the bright side of the face isn''t over exposed. The dark side of the face looks a little contrived on how dark it is. The curvy line on the forehead looks artificial, shadow-wise. Did you darken these? Or am I just not understanding the lighting? -7-', '2019-08-20 10:55:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(7638575, 1239718, 103142, '<td valign="top">Another one that confuses me a bit. I''d love to see a discussion on this one. It looks more underexposed that low key. But then I look at the cat, and I don''t think it is. But with such a hard light coming in to make such hard shadows, it seems like the lit areas would be brighter. 6 for now. I need to think on this one more.</td>', 'Another one that confuses me a bit. I''d love to see a discussion on this one. It looks more underexposed that low key. But then I look at the cat, and I don''t think it is. But with such a hard light coming in to make such hard shadows, it seems like the lit areas would be brighter. 6 for now. I need to think on this one more.', '2019-08-20 10:57:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(7638576, 1239756, 103142, '<td valign="top">Yup -- this one works. Doesn''t look contrived. Nice darks, nice highlights.</td>', 'Yup -- this one works. Doesn''t look contrived. Nice darks, nice highlights.', '2019-08-20 10:58:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(7638577, 1239752, 103142, '<td valign="top">Yup. Love it. Never would have thought of doing this for low key. Great idea!</td>', 'Yup. Love it. Never would have thought of doing this for low key. Great idea!', '2019-08-20 10:59:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(7638578, 1239842, 103142, '<td valign="top">Lovely</td>', 'Lovely', '2019-08-20 10:59:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(7638579, 1239818, 103142, '<td valign="top">Nicely done. Not quite sure about the orange tint...</td>', 'Nicely done. Not quite sure about the orange tint...', '2019-08-20 11:00:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(7638580, 1239690, 103142, '<td valign="top">I''m confused on this one. I hate to say it, but it''s not my definition of low key. <br/> <br/>It''s hard to say it, because this is so incredibly beautifully done.<br/> <br/>So I looked up 6-7 other places for low key definition. Mostly dark, heavy shadows, moody, dramatic. <br/> <br/>I guess to me it would have been more low key if you hadn''t lit him so completely. If the shadows would have been left to fall into dark.<br/> <br/>And yet I hesitate to vote on this, because I could be wrong.<br/> <br/>It should be a 9 for beauty, but it''s a 6 for low key. (I should have just voted without leaving a comment, I think!)</td>', 'I''m confused on this one. I hate to say it, but it''s not my definition of low key.  It''s hard to say it, because this is so incredibly beautifully done. So I looked up 6-7 other places for low key definition. Mostly dark, heavy shadows, moody, dramatic.  I guess to me it would have been more low key if you hadn''t lit him so completely. If the shadows would have been left to fall into dark. And yet I hesitate to vote on this, because I could be wrong. It should be a 9 for beauty, but it''s a 6 for low key. (I should have just voted without leaving a comment, I think!)', '2019-08-20 11:07:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(7638581, 1239866, 103142, '<td valign="top">Another one that doesn''t look low key -- just looks underexposed. I think this could have been completely fantastic if the shadows were let to go darker and the highlighted fruit was let to BE highlighted and just pop.</td>', 'Another one that doesn''t look low key -- just looks underexposed. I think this could have been completely fantastic if the shadows were let to go darker and the highlighted fruit was let to BE highlighted and just pop.', '2019-08-20 11:08:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(7638582, 1239867, 67258, '<td valign="top">The subject is really rather bright, some brightness in a generally low key image can work well, but here the entire subject is exposed normally.  More to the point, and the reason I have voted this one just a 4, the items appear to be floating in mid air.  The black background is totally black, no texture, and no sense of the wine bottle et al sitting on a surface.</td>', 'The subject is really rather bright, some brightness in a generally low key image can work well, but here the entire subject is exposed normally.  More to the point, and the reason I have voted this one just a 4, the items appear to be floating in mid air.  The black background is totally black, no texture, and no sense of the wine bottle et al sitting on a surface.', '2019-08-20 11:09:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(7638584, 1239848, 67258, '<td valign="top">Low key, and the title suits the image - indeed, it sums up my feelings when viewing.  For me, it doesn''t engage me - it just isn''t interesting enough to fully pique my curiosity. The empty chairs, bins and trolley are the interesting part to me, but the bright area of sky draws my eye up to the carpark, and I am left just thinking meh.</td>', 'Low key, and the title suits the image - indeed, it sums up my feelings when viewing.  For me, it doesn''t engage me - it just isn''t interesting enough to fully pique my curiosity. The empty chairs, bins and trolley are the interesting part to me, but the bright area of sky draws my eye up to the carpark, and I am left just thinking meh.', '2019-08-20 11:13:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(7638585, 1239782, 101668, '<td valign="top">Great image, love the shadow lines of the glasses.</td>', 'Great image, love the shadow lines of the glasses.', '2019-08-20 11:13:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(7638586, 1239432, 101668, '<td valign="top">Too pretty! Love it</td>', 'Too pretty! Love it', '2019-08-20 11:13:57.000000', NULL, 1),
