(7638655, 1239863, 86447, '<td valign="top">It''s probable that I don''t understand Low Key and so my opinion on this is incorrect, but...  I think the brightness of the major part of this image is too bright for low key.  It''s almost harsh for me to look at... with such a big contrast in the blown whites (to which I do not object if this were in a different challenge) and the extreme darks. <br/>I love the sharpness of the sun/moon.  That''s hard to do shooting into the light.<br/>It''s a moody image that makes me feel something... and that''s the point of an image, right?</td>', 'It''s probable that I don''t understand Low Key and so my opinion on this is incorrect, but...  I think the brightness of the major part of this image is too bright for low key.  It''s almost harsh for me to look at... with such a big contrast in the blown whites (to which I do not object if this were in a different challenge) and the extreme darks. I love the sharpness of the sun/moon.  That''s hard to do shooting into the light.It''s a moody image that makes me feel something... and that''s the point of an image, right?', '2019-08-20 13:45:06.000000', NULL, 1),
