(7638731, 1239878, 103142, '<td valign="top">I would have liked the face turned just a tad more this way. The lighting on the upper body is so wonderful, but the highlight on the face is harsh and makes the eye look a little odd. Maybe just a tiny tad of fill light on the front of the face?</td>', 'I would have liked the face turned just a tad more this way. The lighting on the upper body is so wonderful, but the highlight on the face is harsh and makes the eye look a little odd. Maybe just a tiny tad of fill light on the front of the face?', '2019-08-20 17:42:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(7638732, 1239864, 103142, '<td valign="top">The face is really quite cool. I wish there was more contrast in this so it looked a little more deliberate and not like it was underexposed.</td>', 'The face is really quite cool. I wish there was more contrast in this so it looked a little more deliberate and not like it was underexposed.', '2019-08-20 17:43:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(7638733, 1239754, 103142, '<td valign="top">Nicely lit. I''m curious as to where people will find this low key. The definitions I''m seeing is mostly dark with a few highlights. Perhaps if the greens and the stem disappeared more into the shadows? <br/> <br/>I may be way off on this. I apologize if I am. But people were curious as to the reason for the votes.</td>', 'Nicely lit. I''m curious as to where people will find this low key. The definitions I''m seeing is mostly dark with a few highlights. Perhaps if the greens and the stem disappeared more into the shadows?  I may be way off on this. I apologize if I am. But people were curious as to the reason for the votes.', '2019-08-20 17:45:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(7638734, 1239787, 103142, '<td valign="top">This is more low key, imo than some of the other flowers. Mostly darks with a few highlights and things disappearing into the shadows.</td>', 'This is more low key, imo than some of the other flowers. Mostly darks with a few highlights and things disappearing into the shadows.', '2019-08-20 17:46:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(7638735, 1239799, 103142, '<td valign="top">Doesn''t fit low key, imo. It''s not really mostly dark -- it''s mostly mid greys and the white hat isn''t really a highlight. sorry.</td>', 'Doesn''t fit low key, imo. It''s not really mostly dark -- it''s mostly mid greys and the white hat isn''t really a highlight. sorry.', '2019-08-20 17:48:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(7638736, 1239441, 103142, '<td valign="top">This is a marvelous photo -- but it doesn''t fit low key, imo. It looks more under exposed than low key. But I do like it, just not in this challenge.</td>', 'This is a marvelous photo -- but it doesn''t fit low key, imo. It looks more under exposed than low key. But I do like it, just not in this challenge.', '2019-08-20 17:48:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(7638737, 1239782, 103142, '<td valign="top">Nicely done.</td>', 'Nicely done.', '2019-08-20 17:49:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(7638739, 1239738, 103142, '<td valign="top">Very beautiful! Did you smooth her face, or is it that smooth? Looks a little too perfect on the nose and cheek.</td>', 'Very beautiful! Did you smooth her face, or is it that smooth? Looks a little too perfect on the nose and cheek.', '2019-08-20 17:51:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(7638740, 1239819, 103142, '<td valign="top">The description of the challenge says mostly dark with a few highlights. While this is a fun shot, it''s mostly light with a few dark elements. Fun find, but not low key, imo</td>', 'The description of the challenge says mostly dark with a few highlights. While this is a fun shot, it''s mostly light with a few dark elements. Fun find, but not low key, imo', '2019-08-20 17:52:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(7638741, 1239862, 103142, '<td valign="top">lovely</td>', 'lovely', '2019-08-20 17:52:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(7638742, 1239879, 103142, '<td valign="top">Right idea -- but it looks more underexposed than low key.</td>', 'Right idea -- but it looks more underexposed than low key.', '2019-08-20 17:53:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(7638743, 1239867, 103142, '<td valign="top">A good attempt, but a couple of thoughts: It''s not straight. You need to rotate it a small bit to the left. Also, you have dust on your black background. It distracts from the photo and yet is easily fixed in post. Also, it''s not really low key. It''s just a nicely exposed photo on a black background. Some more dramatic side lighting were parts of the subject falls into shadow would produce a more low key image.</td>', 'A good attempt, but a couple of thoughts: It''s not straight. You need to rotate it a small bit to the left. Also, you have dust on your black background. It distracts from the photo and yet is easily fixed in post. Also, it''s not really low key. It''s just a nicely exposed photo on a black background. Some more dramatic side lighting were parts of the subject falls into shadow would produce a more low key image.', '2019-08-20 17:55:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(7638744, 1239865, 103142, '<td valign="top">Sorry -- it''s another one that just looks underexposed instead of low key. If you would have kept it in color and exposed it right with some cool side lighting, it could have been stunning, imo.</td>', 'Sorry -- it''s another one that just looks underexposed instead of low key. If you would have kept it in color and exposed it right with some cool side lighting, it could have been stunning, imo.', '2019-08-20 17:56:14.000000', NULL, 1),
