(7638818, 1239738, 24454, '<td valign="top">This is not only my favorite photo in this challenge, its one of my favorite low key portraits Ive ever seen.  It had to get first place!  As I mentioned, it will be my bar in my future attempts to capture an artistic low key image.   I think her soft skin makes it even more stunning, and if you blow the image up, you can tell its very natural and unedited.  Congratulations on a ton of levels!</td>', 'This is not only my favorite photo in this challenge, its one of my favorite low key portraits Ive ever seen.  It had to get first place!  As I mentioned, it will be my bar in my future attempts to capture an artistic low key image.   I think her soft skin makes it even more stunning, and if you blow the image up, you can tell its very natural and unedited.  Congratulations on a ton of levels!', '2019-08-21 01:15:37.000000', NULL, 0),
