(7638826, 1239878, 24454, '<td valign="top">This is one of the images that took my breath away!  Just the right amount of light to see her eyes and outline.  The perfect pose to be dramatic and oh so elegant!</td>', 'This is one of the images that took my breath away!  Just the right amount of light to see her eyes and outline.  The perfect pose to be dramatic and oh so elegant!', '2019-08-21 01:35:14.000000', NULL, 0),
(7638831, 1239610, 24454, '<td valign="top">Well, I have to say that I totally agree with you.  This image is exquisite, and was the one I loved most alongside Mary Annes winning image.  They are both similar to me in beauty and perfect use of light and shadows.  I am shocked to see it in a very undeserving 11th place.  I added it to my favorites during the challenge and will come back to it often as I try to improve my low key photography.</td>', 'Well, I have to say that I totally agree with you.  This image is exquisite, and was the one I loved most alongside Mary Annes winning image.  They are both similar to me in beauty and perfect use of light and shadows.  I am shocked to see it in a very undeserving 11th place.  I added it to my favorites during the challenge and will come back to it often as I try to improve my low key photography.', '2019-08-21 01:46:09.000000', NULL, 0),
(7638832, 1239447, 24454, '<td valign="top">This one also, in my opinion should have been in the top three!  It is an absolutely fabulous art piece!</td>', 'This one also, in my opinion should have been in the top three!  It is an absolutely fabulous art piece!', '2019-08-21 01:47:24.000000', NULL, 0),
