(7638869, 1239519, 67258, '<td valign="top">Sascha is a definite handful.  He is the most adorable, loving dog you can imagine, but he does like to play a game of stealing things.  Once you engage by chasing him, that''s it, you''ll be at it for the next couple of hours.  He particularly like, in order of preference, an old soft toy of mine, my glasses, my computer mouse, the cat''s bed, my purse.... He loves coming to visit as my son doesn''t have a back garden (although amazing countryside direct from the front door), but I won''t allow him in the back garden unsupervised as he digs..and digs...and digs....<br/> <br/>I was astounded Wendy managed to get him to sit long enough to take a photo - most of mine are action shots of him running! So, thank you to Wendy for minding him, and also for the lovely photo.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2019-08-21 04:37:35.</i></td>', 'Sascha is a definite handful.  He is the most adorable, loving dog you can imagine, but he does like to play a game of stealing things.  Once you engage by chasing him, that''s it, you''ll be at it for the next couple of hours.  He particularly like, in order of preference, an old soft toy of mine, my glasses, my computer mouse, the cat''s bed, my purse.... He loves coming to visit as my son doesn''t have a back garden (although amazing countryside direct from the front door), but I won''t allow him in the back garden unsupervised as he digs..and digs...and digs.... I was astounded Wendy managed to get him to sit long enough to take a photo - most of mine are action shots of him running! So, thank you to Wendy for minding him, and also for the lovely photo.', '2019-08-21 05:35:56.000000', '2019-08-21 05:37:35.000000', 0),
(7638871, 1239547, 67258, '<td valign="top">This was up amongst my favourites of the challenge, a superbly understated image - pleased to see it awarded some bling.</td>', 'This was up amongst my favourites of the challenge, a superbly understated image - pleased to see it awarded some bling.', '2019-08-21 05:44:26.000000', NULL, 0),
(7638880, 1239547, 173844, '<td valign="top">What they said.  Seen many photos of the Golden Gate Bridge.  Beauty and majesty are well represented, whereas this take is besotted with mystery and mood, the dim of night.  If they lived in SF, this is the bridge that Sam Spade and Philip Marlowe would cross.  Wonderful spiky cables and gleaming patch of the bay.  And the grain, a wash of minor tones.  Memorable.<br/>Personal favorite of the challenge.</td>', 'What they said.  Seen many photos of the Golden Gate Bridge.  Beauty and majesty are well represented, whereas this take is besotted with mystery and mood, the dim of night.  If they lived in SF, this is the bridge that Sam Spade and Philip Marlowe would cross.  Wonderful spiky cables and gleaming patch of the bay.  And the grain, a wash of minor tones.  Memorable.Personal favorite of the challenge.', '2019-08-21 09:26:24.000000', NULL, 0),
(7638881, 1239878, 173844, '<td valign="top">Terrific.  A holy icon to be hung in the heart of a home.</td>', 'Terrific.  A holy icon to be hung in the heart of a home.', '2019-08-21 09:31:43.000000', NULL, 0),
